    "status": "approx",
    "notes": "Auto-converted from Xiaomi camera config; needs visual audit. Right band content is 100% EXIF/brand driven: with an EXIF source that carries no focal/aperture/shutter/ISO (e.g. a PNG, or a JPEG whose optics tags were stripped) the band measures and paints empty except the leica dot, which is a fixture state, not a layout failure. Verified 2026-11-19 against bundle exif.jpg at 4:3 / 9:16 / 16:9 / 1:1 / 9:20: the rotated band paints at every ratio (non-white ink inside the 114-wide strip).",
